<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0342_R10PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Trap House by a cave? That’s MAD\nconvenient. Somebody’s genius.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0342_R10PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Last time I came by the Power Plant, I\nheard somebody SCREAM,\f“OH NO, IT MUSTA BEEN A THIEF!”\rI think it was the Manager. He scream a\nlot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0342_R10PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard The Feds got back together in\nJohto but fell apart right away.\rLike a boy band. Like EVERY boy band.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0342_R10PC0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t see it from here, but\nthere’s a Power Plant south of this\fTrap House!\fYou can hear it hummin’. All night.</language>
	</row>
</body>
